  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Stone_Block?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/37/Stone_Block.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028131613\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Stone blocks\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Stone blocks\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Stone blocks</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/supplies-23344\" title=\"Supplies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Supply</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 34</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 1 to 342</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Upgrades </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/grocery-store-13191\" title=\"Grocery Store\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Grocery Store</a></span><span title=\"Grocery store\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/grocery-store-13191\" title=\"Grocery Store\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Grocery Store\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/7e/Grocery_Store.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/38?cb=20250926034449\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"38\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span>  <span>Gift Shop</span><span title=\"Gift shop\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/gift-shop-15760\" title=\"Gift Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Gift Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span> <span>Spa</span><span title=\"Spa\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/spa-13195\" title=\"Spa\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Spa\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span> <span>Town Hall</span><span title=\"Town hall\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/town-hall-13238\" title=\"Town Hall\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Town Hall\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Default: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 95</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 10</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Stone blocks</b> are <a href=\"/wiki/supplies-23344\" title=\"Supplies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">supplies</a> used to upgrade the <a href=\"/wiki/grocery-store-13191\" title=\"Grocery Store\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">grocery store</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/gift-shop-15760\" title=\"Gift Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">gift shop</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/spa-13195\" title=\"Spa\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">spa</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/town-hall-13238\" title=\"Town Hall\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Town Hall</a>.\n</p><p>They are unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 34.\n</p><p>They are stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">barn</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Getting stone blocks</b></span></h3>\n<p>A sure way to get a stone block is to buy it with 10 <span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>.\n</p><p>Stone blocks can also sometimes be found in <a href=\"/wiki/roadside-shop-2677\" title=\"Roadside Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">roadside shops</a> for 1 to 342 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> per unit.\n</p><p>Finally, stone blocks can be randomly obtained when players:\n</p>\n<ul><li>open <a href=\"/wiki/mystery-box-6452\" title=\"Mystery Box\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mystery boxes</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/catalogue-8567\" title=\"Catalogue\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mystery packages</a></li>\n<li>spin the <a href=\"/wiki/wheel-of-fortune-2745\" title=\"Wheel of Fortune\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Wheel of Fortune</a></li>\n<li>fully satisfy a <a href=\"/wiki/town-visitors-13241\" title=\"Town Visitors\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">town visitor</a></li>\n<li>win prizes in <a href=\"/wiki/derby-18422\" title=\"Derby\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">derbies</a></li>\n<li>use <a href=\"/wiki/mystery-net-16940\" title=\"Mystery Net\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mystery nets</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/fishing-lake-23340\" title=\"Fishing Lake\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fishing lake</a></li>\n<li>watch a Night at the Movies <a href=\"/wiki/trailer-29582\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trailer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">trailer</a></li></ul>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"navmenutitle\">See also</div><div class=\"navmenubox\">\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-none wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/axe-3051\" title=\"Axe 